#. [era], id=ARCHAIC_ERA
#: ./eras/Archaic_Era.cfg:5
msgid "Archaic Era"
msgstr ""

#. [era], id=ARCHAIC_ERA
#: ./eras/Archaic_Era.cfg:7
msgid ""
"A UMC era with the main races from SP Campaign add-on Bad Moon Rising:\n"
"\n"
"Ukians (UMC) - A bit like scruffy Loyalists from the far north\n"
"\n"
"Northern Orcs (UMC) - Somewhat like mainline 'Northerners' faction, but not "
"really ...  A new line of Orcs\n"
"\n"
"Despair (UMC) - A sort of Undead-like faction, but more focused on the ghosts"
" than the skeletons and ghouls\n"
"\n"
"Khthon (UMC) - Dark Spirits manifested as possessed animals\n"
"\n"
"Northerners (Mainline), Undead (Mainline), and Loyalists (Mainline)  - You "
"know who these guys are.\n"
"\n"
"Somewhat balanced, but far from perfect."
msgstr ""

#. [era], id=ARCHAIC_ERA_EXTENDED
#: ./eras/Archaic_Era.cfg:38
msgid "Archaic Era - Extended"
msgstr ""

#. [era], id=ARCHAIC_ERA_EXTENDED
#: ./eras/Archaic_Era.cfg:39
msgid ""
"A UMC era with the races in the add-ons Bad Moon Rising and Trinity.  "
"Includes the factions in standard Archaic Era, as well as:\n"
"\n"
" Menagerie (UMC) - Conglomerate of enemies from SP Campaign Trinity.  The "
"overall theme is... weird and alien, hopefully entertaining.\n"
"\n"
" South-Seas (UMC) - Humans from lands to the south of Weldyn and the known "
"realm of Wesnoth.  They got where they did by sailing the high seas.\n"
"\n"
" Primeval (UMC)* - An arrogant, militant, and somewhat hedonistic race that "
"predated the humans, elves, dwarves, trolls, and orcs, and had battled the "
"ancestors of those modern races.  \n"
"\n"
" Phantom (UMC)* - An ancient and powerful civilization from long, long ago, "
"that was defeated and enthralled by an alien invader.  \n"
"\n"
"*NOTE: Phantom and Primeval factions are overpowered, and not included in "
"Random Faction options."
msgstr ""

