#. [race], id=despair, help_taxonomy=undead
#: ./units/despair_race.cfg:11
msgid ""
"The Northlands can be cruel and unforgiving, and many have succombed to the "
"stinging claws of the arctic winds.  Many have also been lost to desperate "
"northern predators, or died fighting the fearsome northern orcish banners.  "
"While none are victims of human necromancers, many of those poor souls still "
"do not escape to wherever it is souls go, but are trapped in this world, to "
"haunt the frozen north."
msgstr ""

