#: ./units/khthon_race.cfg:12
msgid ""
"These ancient enemies of the Primeval Forces are difficult to comprehend. "
"They are best described as spirits that animate the bodies of victims, and "
"slowly cause those victims to undergo transformations. The Primeval Forces "
"have developed an immunity to this, but the more modern inhabitants of the "
"continent (with the exception of the non-living) are vulnerable."
