#. [race], id=magnellian, help_taxonomy=human
#: ./units/menagerie_race.cfg:31
msgid ""
"The race of men is an extremely diverse one, and it doesn't just span "
"continents.  Magnellians hail from a land across the vast, dark, impossible "
"gulf of outerspace.  These intrepid explorers and diligent researchers "
"reached for the stars, and were rewarded for their efforts for many "
"generations.  This accomplishment hit a sour note, however, when the "
"Magnellian explorers encountered a rogue planet covered with archaic ruins.\n"
"\n"
"Though they didn't know it at the time, the Magnellians had stumbled across "
"the Destroyer; a malevolent force that lurks in the space between worlds and "
"ensures no civilization can spread across the universe.  It took many "
"decades, but the Magnellian civilization eventually fell to this new enemy.  "
"The elements that still function are thralls to the Destroyer."
msgstr ""

