#. [race], id=dogman, help_taxonomy=wolf
#: ./units/orcs_race.cfg:23
msgid ""
"The orcs and wolves of the northlands share their frigid pine forests with a "
"race of dogmen.  They do not seem to have a concept of ownership or property,"
" so there is less competition and conflict with the orcs than one might "
"expect.  In return for free passage through orcish territory, as well as some"
" crude equipment and weapons, the dogmen often serve as scouts and "
"auxiliaries for the stronger orcish banners."
msgstr ""

