#. [race], id=phantom_wales
#: ./units/phantom_race.cfg:11
msgid ""
"As Huric's rule came to a close and the orcs began reclaiming Ukian "
"territory, many of the human forces were slain. Somehow the dead continue to "
"roam the tundra, but unlike ghosts, they are not slaves to practioners of "
"Necromancy. Instead, they are slaves to their own desires for revenge."
msgstr ""

