#. [unit_type], id=Tri_Blue_Novice, race=magnellian, gender=male
#: ./units/menagerie/Blue_Novice.cfg:21
msgid ""
"Most people of Magnellia were engaged in pursuits of commerce or "
"entertainment, for they had conquered hunger, disease, and the beasts of the "
"night.  When a dark rogue planet showed up and rained down its plagues of "
"vermin and ghosts on their peaceful world, there was a concerted push to "
"swell the ranks of the technical field to manufacture, strengthen, lead, and "
"support a mechanized defense force.  The Blue Novices are non-specialized "
"workers in training to become either fire-wielding overseer Mages or the more"
" support- and defense-oriented Engineers."
msgstr ""

