msgid "Orcish Cavalry"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=Orcish Cavalry, race=orc
#: ./units/orcs/Cavalry.cfg:21
msgid ""
"The more experienced riders have acquired better armor and have also learned "
"how to keep their mount from getting pierced in the throught. Because of "
"their skill and utility in the battlefield, the veteran cavalry are members "
"of a respected class that can stay somewhat above the rat race that other "
"orcs must engage in."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=Orcish Destrier, race=orc
#: ./units/orcs/Destrier.cfg:5
msgid "Orcish Destrier"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=Orcish Destrier, race=orc
#: ./units/orcs/Destrier.cfg:24
msgid ""
"The elite members of the orcish cavalry have reached a great level of prowess"
" and notoriety upon the battle field, but are expensive to maintain for both "
"orc and mount must be in top physical shape. As a result, they do not try to "
"become warlords, but seek warlord patrons who will pay their upkeep in "
"exchange for the long and strong arm they can provide."
msgstr ""

