#. [unit_type], id=Orcish Drifter, race=north_orc
#: ./units/orcs/Drifter.cfg:20
msgid ""
"Some orcs have finer features and less physical strength, it's not clear they"
" are even of the same species.  These Drifters move from clan to clan, "
"helping their hosts with esoteric arts not otherwise available to the orcish "
"clans.  They are also messengers of higher-level, inter-clan, messages.  They"
" are essentially diplomats and observers, and have learned learned how to "
"deal with the ghosts that roam the northern drifts."
msgstr ""

