#. [unit_type], id=Primeval Velite, race=primeval
#: ./units/primeval/Velite.cfg:5
msgid "Velite"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=Primeval Velite, race=primeval
#: ./units/primeval/Velite.cfg:25
msgid ""
"The Velites are the weakest and lowest-ranking of the Primeval males.  They "
"are denied the chance to join the proper warrior class, and usually spend "
"their days working in construction and maintenance, out of sight of the more "
"favored classes.  Their only path to recognition and acceptance is to "
"demonstrate extreme valor and dedication in combat."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=Primeval Hastate, race=primeval
#. [unit_type], id=Primeval Hektor
#: ./units/primeval/Velite_Hastate.cfg:5
#: ./units/primeval/Velite_Hastate.cfg:93
msgid "Hastate"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=Primeval Hastate, race=primeval
#: ./units/primeval/Velite_Hastate.cfg:26
msgid ""
"Successful Velites gain experience and status, joining the ranks of the "
"Hastates, and get one step closer to the priviledge of walking amongst the "
"warriors, gods, and females.  They get better equipment, but their tactics "
"remain the same: attack with extreme dedication and valor."
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=Primeval Peltast, race=primeval
#: ./units/primeval/Velite_Peltast.cfg:7
msgid "Peltast"
msgstr ""

