msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=SouthSeas Salvager, race=south-seas_human, gender=male
#: ./units/south-seas/Shoreman_Salvager.cfg:5
msgid "Salvager"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=SouthSeas Salvager, race=south-seas_human, gender=male
#: ./units/south-seas/Shoreman_Salvager.cfg:21
msgid ""
"The Salvagers are less concerned with the loading and unloading of ships, and"
" focus their efforts on the more lucrative job of salvage.  They break apart "
"old ships and sell what can be sold.  Long lances are useful in prodding "
"floating wood, as well as poking hostile forces."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=pierce, range=ranged
#: ./units/south-seas/Shoreman_Salvager.cfg:53
msgid "barb"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=SouthSeas Seawolf, race=south-seas_human, gender=male
#: ./units/south-seas/Shoreman_Wolf.cfg:5
msgid "Sea Wolf"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=SouthSeas Wrecker, race=south-seas_human, gender=male
#: ./units/south-seas/Shoreman_Wrecker.cfg:5
msgid "Wrecker"
msgstr ""

#. [unit_type], id=SouthSeas Wrecker, race=south-seas_human, gender=male
#: ./units/south-seas/Shoreman_Wrecker.cfg:23
msgid ""
"The Wreckers are the most experienced of the salvagers.  They usually operate"
" alone, which maximizes both the profit and danger, so they carry harpoons to"
" fight off sharks, thieves, and other Wreckers."
msgstr ""

#. [attack], type=pierce, range=ranged
#: ./units/south-seas/Shoreman_Wrecker.cfg:56
#: ./units/south-seas/Swimmers_Divers.cfg:59
#: ./units/south-seas/Swimmers_Marines.cfg:62
